  "docTitle": "Time-Slot Reservation (CoWIN / Rooms / Service Centres) - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Design a 'book a limited slot' system: CoWIN vaccine appointments, adventure-park ride slots, car service centres and meeting rooms. Slot inventory, geo search, holds with a TTL, no double booking, payment webhooks, Saga, surge queues and capacity estimation.",
  "hero": {
