    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">50 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip accent\">HLD design</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Tekion</span><span class=\"chip company\">Salesforce</span><span class=\"chip company\">Yellow.ai</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Time-Slot Reservation (CoWIN / Rooms / Service Centres)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">One design that answers a whole family of interview questions: \"book a vaccine slot near me\", \"book one of 8 seats on a ride\", \"book my car's service\", \"book the meeting room at 3 pm\". You will learn the slot inventory model, holds that expire, the one database write that stops double booking, payments with webhooks and a Saga, and how to survive the minute when everyone clicks at once.</p>\n      "
  },
